lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiaoxia, Xiaobai, and Xiaonan are classmates, they are preparing a group report. Xiaoxia, as the team leader, is responsible for assigning tasks to the three of them today. But Xiaoxia and Xiaobai have already discussed, they hope to let Xiaonan do more parts. During the discussion, Xiaoxia gives examples to explain the skills needed for the task, and looks at Xiaobai, saying: \"Xiaobai, this part of the task is very important and a bit difficult, can you complete it?\" Xiaobai immediately replies: \"I already take on the work of other parts and start doing it.\" At this time, Xiaonan notices that they are looking at him together, but they do not speak.\n\n[Question]\nWhat do you think Xiaonan feels at that time?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiaonan feels happy and confident about the important task she is assigned.\nB. Xiaonan feels a bit stunned, she does not expect this complex task to fall on her.\nC. Xiaonan feels that she is ignored and excluded by Xiaoxia and Xiaobai.\nD. Xiaonan feels angry because she resents Xiaoxia and Xiaobai for discussing in advance to deal with her.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002182639506055526,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b60c2ddb05a7fe30357","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452320993,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:58:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"bdc4256cab7a4ae9bc0ecd3d8a19d030"}